{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground</strong> is a first-person horror adventure where you wake up lost, with no memory of how you got here \u2014 and no idea where &quot;home&quot; is. As you explore a strange and seemingly abandoned subway system, you begin to uncover notes, clues, and puzzles that guide you from station to station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not alone down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive encounters with terrifying entities that stalk the tunnels. Make decisions that affect your survival, and solve increasingly complex puzzles that block your escape. Each station presents a unique challenge \u2014 from tracking down the right medication for a patient under time pressure, to escaping a deadly chase after choosing the wrong item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven single-player horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple underground stations</strong>, each with its own set of puzzles, atmosphere, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints</strong> between stations so progress isn\u2019t lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mix of stealth, puzzle-solving, and decision-based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic horror elements</strong> that react to your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI for full immersion</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729730?t=1764515747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729730?t=1764515747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/5c773eaaf14cdbfe9d0a6f1b8de6ee123d9aa627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764515747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/5c773eaaf14cdbfe9d0a6f1b8de6ee123d9aa627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764515747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Environmental Puzzles</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/extras/c795d502d833445b004f7b13d92e43f9.avif?t=1764515747\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/extras_big/c795d502d833445b004f7b13d92e43f9.avif?t=1764515747 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use notes, clues, and observations to solve puzzles. Sometimes the answer is right in front of you \u2014 and sometimes it\u2019s hidden in the shadows.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground</strong> is a first-person horror adventure where you wake up lost, with no memory of how you got here \u2014 and no idea where &quot;home&quot; is. As you explore a strange and seemingly abandoned subway system, you begin to uncover notes, clues, and puzzles that guide you from station to station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not alone down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive encounters with terrifying entities that stalk the tunnels. Make decisions that affect your survival, and solve increasingly complex puzzles that block your escape. Each station presents a unique challenge \u2014 from tracking down the right medication for a patient under time pressure, to escaping a deadly chase after choosing the wrong item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven single-player horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple underground stations</strong>, each with its own set of puzzles, atmosphere, and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints</strong> between stations so progress isn\u2019t lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mix of stealth, puzzle-solving, and decision-based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic horror elements</strong> that react to your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI for full immersion</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Ecstatic Group Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729730/b155b09760422219ebccbd8435f402a502c95b7c/header.jpg?t=1764515747","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729730/1368581036/0cdfe1cf297480f0115b29883a97000a74f5fd16/1750395739/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748010696","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729730/1368581036/0cdfe1cf297480f0115b29883a97000a74f5fd16/1750395739/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748010696","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729730/1368581036/0cdfe1cf297480f0115b29883a97000a74f5fd16/1750395739/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748010696","id":257144301,"name":"Underground Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144301/9640d8d5f65e9d74610b295ccdec4990d33b63e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748010696"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729730/1873876473/b29be0feea182c857cddec5082c51af01e738866/1750395743/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747374779","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729730/1873876473/b29be0feea182c857cddec5082c51af01e738866/1750395743/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747374779","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store